OrbitKV GPU TurboQuant implementation

The TurboQuant kernels and codebook construction in
crates/orbitkv-core/src/codec/ are adapted from the Apache-2.0 LMCache
TurboQuant serde at commit 05a013b29da78cf2321b9b46ec5039dde2fb0bb0:
https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/05a013b29da78cf2321b9b46ec5039dde2fb0bb0/lmcache/v1/distributed/serde/turboquant

Copyright contributors to the vLLM project.

OrbitKV changes include CUDA kernels controlled from Rust, its own versioned
random-sign generator and wire layout, per-segment validation, and integration
with leased DRAM, SSD and peer cache storage. The Apache-2.0 license is provided
in LICENSE. NVIDIA nvCOMP is an optional separately installed dependency;
its headers and binaries are not redistributed in this package.

Mooncake TENT runtime

The wheel includes Mooncake TENT and its common libraries from the pinned
third-party/mooncake source. Mooncake's Apache-2.0 license is retained in the
wheel's native license directory. Native dependencies bundled by auditwheel
retain their package copyright notices and referenced license texts in that
directory; its dependency SBOM records the available package provenance.
Python, NVIDIA CUDA runtime/driver and RDMA driver libraries are supplied by
the runtime environment and are not redistributed by this build step.
